<rml>
    <head>
        <title>GameRules</title>
        <link type="text/template" href="Base/BasePopup.rml" />
        <link type="text/rcss" href="Base/WindowTitle.rcss" />
        <link type="text/rcss" href="GameRules.rcss" />
    </head>
    <body template="BasePopup" class="show-scrollbar wondow-content-full wondow-content-horizontal">
        <div id="gamerules-popup" class="font-content">
            <div>
                <div id="window-title">
                    <div class="title-text font-title label">
                        <span class="color_white">Help & Rules</span>
					</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
				<p>
                    <span class='color_white'><span class='color_green'>Small, Big, and Huge Locks</span> may be deleted after long periods of inactivity if a world is not visited regularly. <span class='color_green'>Item function and prices are subject to change</span> at anytime and without warning as we are constantly trying to balance different aspects of the game.</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <span class='color_white'>Protect your worlds and the items by using Doors, Locks, and Blocks wisely, <span class='color_green'>never share your login credentials</span> with anyone, and be aware of <span class='color_green'>fake system messages and phishing websites</span>.</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <span class='color_white'><span class='color_green'>Inappropriate behavior</span> (profanity, racist, sexist or sexual content, abusive behavior, and bullying); any form of <span class='color_green'>betting or  gambling</span> (Casino, Drop Game, Dirt Game, etc.); <span class='color_green'>buying, selling, or trading Growtopia accounts, items, or worlds</span> for real money; <span class='color_green'>purchase fraud</span>; and usage of <span class='color_green'>third party software</span>, including, but not limited to, client-side manipulation, auto-clickers, speed hacks, clock manipulation, bots, macroing, and auto-farming, will be sanctioned and may result in a permanent suspension.</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <span class='color_white'>You can find more information on game rules on </span>
                    <span class='color_medium_blue link'
                          href="https://ubisoft-mobile.helpshift.com/hc/en/26-growtopia/section/337-the-growtopian-code/"
                          onclick="OnEvent(event, 'gamerules.OnOpenLink')"
                          >
                          The Growtopian Code</span>
                </p>
                    
                <div class="top-padding buttons-panel" >
                        <div onclick="OnEvent(event, 'gamerules.OnAccept')" class="button button-green-color">
                            <span class="label">I accept these rules!</span>
                        </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</rml>
